 index, Then you will be presented with a color that indicates whether the conditions are favorable, moderate, or severe. When you view a future weather conditions for that city, Then  you will be  presented with a 5-day forecast that displays the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the wind speed, and the humidity. When you click on a city in the search history, Then you will be presented with current and future conditions for that city.","topics":[],"score":226809,"global_rank":122514},{"name":"kashsomani/kashsomani.com-svelte-express","owner":"kashsomani","html_url":"https://github.com/kashsomani/kashsomani.com-svelte-express","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226809,"global_rank":122517},{"name":"Matthewwalker333/weather_dashboard","owner":"Matthewwalker333","html_url":"https://github.com/Matthewwalker333/weather_dashboard","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226809,"global_rank":122518},{"name":"aptaylor87/Jasmine","owner":"aptaylor87","html_url":"https://github.com/aptaylor87/Jasmine","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226809,"global_rank":122520},{"name":"mingmanhk/Online-Offline-Budget-Trackers","owner":"mingmanhk","html_url":"https://github.com/mingmanhk/Online-Offline-Budget-Trackers","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226809,"global_rank":122521},{"name":"apocist/uniformity","owner":"apocist","html_url":"https://github.com/apocist/uniformity","stars":1,"forks":4,"watchers":1,"issues":6,"language":"JavaScript","description":"First attempts at a CMS","topics":[],"score":226807,"global_rank":122524},{"name":"Logan-Code-LV/marioJS","owner":"Logan-Code-LV","html_url":"https://github.com/Logan-Code-LV/marioJS","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"is